    "did_you_know": "There are a number of above-ground subway stations in the Morningside Heights neighborhood of Manhattan.",
    "description": "Sophie Rivera lived near one of the city’s above-ground subway stations and she frequently photographed the men rebuilding the line’s infrastructure. Here she captured a worker mid-leap, echoing the famous and influential idea of a photograph capturing a “decisive moment,” an idea described by French photographer Henri Cartier-Bresson.",
